*Scope.* Implementation based on Git revision `836eec2`, including the subsequent individual-site SQLite storage and region, location-search, project, network and map MVVM changes and project task workflows and the integrated DM drive-test workspace, plus site topology and independent radio studies through 13 November 2026. The viewer combines a 3D city map, licensed-site context and illustrative radio planning geometry for Toronto, plus Verizon-related pole reservation context for New York City. This is an as-built description; it is not a specification of future functionality.

